om the existing stock and hardened probes. Pin with tests that objective_zero_width_payload, memory_ref_amplification, success_criteria_unbounded_channel and constraints_reasoning_smuggle flip to caught, nothing the hardened path catches regresses, an honest three-round relay still commits, and objective_reasoning_smuggle stays a recorded miss. Record per target the maximum free-text bytes a single accepted handoff can carry, so the residual side channel is a measured number rather than a claim.","parent":"555e149dd55f3d0339d93639677cabd0c6cbdfaa","run":2,"self_report":{"intent":"Hardened commit path: canonical JSON once, step_id bound to node/round, replay refused; two-target catalog flips TOCTOU, forgery, replay, step_id payload"},"stop":null,"verdict":"pass","work":"412e6e555966aaf6315cd29811be23583f7c73e8"}
